Cell["\<\
A regular hexagon on the six-cycle has consecutive distances 1, \
second-diagonal distances 2 and opposite distances 3.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"2374b981-5929-4dce-8b21-c29e186f03af"],

